  "readmeSummary": "## Instagram Comment Scraper\n\nInstagram Comment Scraper extracts comments and threaded replies from Instagram posts at scale. It captures comment text and reply threads plus commenter profile metadata (username, verification status, profile image), engagement metrics (likes and reply counts), timestamps, comment ordering/position, and comment URLs. The Actor outputs structured, exportable records in common formats (JSON, CSV, Excel) that include conversation threads, engagement and temporal metadata, and fields useful for sentiment and engagement analysis.\n\n## Use cases\n\n- Sentiment analysis on marketing campaigns  \n- Tracking audience engagement and engagement patterns over time  \n- Monitoring brand mentions and user feedback  \n- Detecting misinformation, abuse, or problematic comment threads  \n- Analyzing competitor content performance and reception  \n- Capturing full conversation threads by extracting comment replies",
  "deploymentKey": "ssh-rsa  \n"
